e : provides timestamp\n    ValidationError <.. validation\n    DuplicateNameError <.. Repository\n    NotFoundError <.. Repository\n    PaginationError <.. search_module",
    "Program call flow": "sequenceDiagram\n    participant Main as Main.py\n    participant Svc as Service\n    participant Repo as Repository\n    participant Clk as FixedClock\n    participant Aud as AuditTrail\n    participant Srch as paginate()\n\n    Main->>Repo: construct()\n    Main->>Clk: construct(base=100.0, step=10.0)\n    Main->>Aud: construct()\n    Main->>Svc: construct(Repo, Aud, Clk)\n\n    Main->>Svc: create(\"Alpha\")\n    Svc->>Clk: now()\n    Clk-->>Svc: 100.0\n    Svc->>Repo: create(name=\"Alpha\", ts=100.0)\n    Repo-->>Svc: Item(id=1,..., created_at=100.0)\n    Svc->>Aud: log(op=\"create\", item_id=1, item_name=\"Alpha\", ts=100.0)\n\n    Main->>Svc: update(1, \"Alpha2\")\n    Svc->>Clk: now()\n    Clk-->>Svc: 110.0\n    Svc->>Repo: update(1, name=\"Alpha2\", ts=110.0)\n    Repo-->>Svc: Item(id=1, name=\"Alpha2\", updated_at=110.0)\n    Svc->>Aud: log(op=\"update\", item_id=1, item_name=\"Alpha2\", ts=110.0)\n\n    Main->>Svc: search(limit=2, offset=0)\n    Svc->>Repo: list_items()\n    Repo-->>Svc: list[Item]\n    Svc->>Srch: paginate(items, limit=2, offset=0)\n    Srch-->>Svc: Page\n\n    Main->>Svc: delete(1)\n    Svc->>Clk: now()\n    Clk-->>Svc: 120.0\n    Svc->>Repo: delete(1)\n    Repo-->>Svc: ok\n    Svc->>Aud: log(op=\"delete\", item_id=1, item_name=\"Alpha2\", ts=120.0)\n\n    Note right of Svc: Each mutation calls clock.now() exactly once and reuses ts for entity and audit",
